224	 * Preferred path for DB-templated sends: render `key` with `vars`, send, log,
225	 * and (for billing templates) attach the invoice. Thin convenience over
226	 * `sendMail` for new callers.
227	 *
228	 * `kind` is forwarded to `sendMail`, which is the ONLY place the notification
229	 * policy is enforced. It used to be absent from this signature, so every send
230	 * routed through this wrapper was structurally incapable of honouring the
231	 * customer's "Account email" preference — a caller could not have opted in even
